# M6D K46 (docs/HIGH_FPS.md 14.8): CONTINUE from the Shadow Depths fixture, walk, the game's Quit save (options menu
# > Quit > save and return to the Title Screen > Yes), then a new game from the title (its first autosaves).
500 tap Return
700 press Return
850 press Return
1000 press Down
1100 press Return
1300 repeat 60 until gameplay press Return
@gameplay+200 down W
@gameplay+400 capture walk
@gameplay+500 up W
@gameplay+520 look 60 0
@gameplay+540 down W
@gameplay+700 up W
@gameplay+800 tap Escape
@gameplay+900 tap Down
@gameplay+930 tap Down
@gameplay+960 tap Down
@gameplay+990 tap Down
@gameplay+1020 tap Down
@gameplay+1100 press Return
@gameplay+1220 press Return
@prompt#2+100 capture title_after_save
@prompt#2+200 tap Return
@prompt#2+400 press Return
@prompt#2+550 press Return
@prompt#2+700 press Down
@prompt#2+800 press Return
@prompt#2+1000 repeat 60 until gameplay#2 press Return
@gameplay#2+200 down W
@gameplay#2+400 capture new_game
@gameplay#2+500 up W
